@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085
@username = rent-cars
@password = recommendations-dev

### 1. Before a successful batch: empty items and null timestamps.
### After make recommendations-build: the latest completed ranking.
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/cars?limit=30
Authorization: Basic {{username}}:{{password}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. Limit is bounded: expect 400.
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/cars?limit=101
Authorization: Basic {{username}}:{{password}}

### 3. Missing credentials: expect 401, not the ranking.
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/cars

### 4. Health is public for Kubernetes probes.
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
